{"unit_id":"bitsmug__dsh-sandbox-mxc#feature-1","repo":"bitsmug/dsh-sandbox-mxc","commit":"1a11c11c6668f574c08fedf7795d2700a594962a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sandbox-mxc 的功能「策略映射」：把 DSH 会话模式与工作区根转换为 MXC 文件系统路径配置，并将原始命令参数交给 wxc-exec。provider 的 confine 调用时触发，结果是容器执行器 argv。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:415","lib/index.js:430","lib/index.js:866"]}
{"unit_id":"bitsmug__dsh-sandbox-mxc#feature-2","repo":"bitsmug/dsh-sandbox-mxc","commit":"1a11c11c6668f574c08fedf7795d2700a594962a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sandbox-mxc 的功能「执行器定位与就绪检查」：从配置、环境变量或 SDK 包查找 wxc-exec，并可在 Windows profile 加载时运行 --probe。找不到执行器或无法选出隔离档时会给出错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:328","lib/index.js:789","lib/index.js:879"]}
{"unit_id":"bitsmug__dsh-sandbox-mxc#feature-3","repo":"bitsmug/dsh-sandbox-mxc","commit":"1a11c11c6668f574c08fedf7795d2700a594962a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sandbox-mxc 的功能「Node 子进程输出兼容」：默认向容器内 Node 注入预载 shim，将同步子进程的管道输出捕获改为临时文件句柄，并让异步 API 立即报错。可通过 injectNodePipeShim 配置关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37","lib/index.js:80","lib/index.js:276"]}
